/-!
# Exact masked helper templates

These definitions are concrete finite instruction lists copied from exact
slices of the frozen 5372-byte artifact.  The lists stop immediately before
the helper `JUMP`; the caller sites add the jump separately.  The slice
theorems below tie every list back to its artifact location.

The compatibility `_constant` argument of `leftTemplate` and `rightTemplate`
is intentionally ignored.  Any embedded `PUSH` constant is fixed by the
group, so semantic callers must use
`StackRoundData.leftConstant (16 * group.val)` or
`StackRoundData.rightConstant (16 * group.val)`.
-/

